  "subject": "情报学研究科_数理工学",
  "text": "设 $D=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb{R}^2\\mid x^2\\le y\\le 2\\}$，求二重积分 $\\displaystyle\\iint_D x^2 y\\,dxdy$ 的值。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "二重积分",
    "累次积分",
    "偶函数对称性",
    "区域描述"
  ],
  "question_type": "二重积分计算",
  "method": [
    "先对 $y$ 积分再对 $x$ 积分（累次积分法）",
    "利用被积函数的偶对称性简化计算"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "确定 $x$ 的取值范围（使 $x^2\\le2$）",
    "对固定 $x$，$y$ 从 $x^2$ 到 $2$ 积分",
    "再对 $x$ 从 $-\\sqrt2$ 到 $\\sqrt2$ 积分，利用偶函数性质化简计算"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "double_integral_region",
    "template": "\\iint_{x^2\\le y\\le 2} x^2 y\\,dxdy",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "结果",
      "steps": [
        "$x$ 的范围：由 $x^2\\le2$ 得 $-\\sqrt2\\le x\\le\\sqrt2$，对固定 $x$，$y\\in[x^2,2]$",
        "内层积分：$\\int_{x^2}^{2} x^2 y\\,dy = x^2\\cdot\\dfrac{y^2}{2}\\Big|_{x^2}^{2}=x^2\\left(2-\\dfrac{x^4}{2}\\right)=2x^2-\\dfrac{x^6}{2}$",
        "外层积分（偶函数，区间对称）：$\\int_{-\\sqrt2}^{\\sqrt2}\\left(2x^2-\\dfrac{x^6}{2}\\right)dx=2\\int_0^{\\sqrt2}\\left(2x^2-\\dfrac{x^6}{2}\\right)dx$",
        "$=2\\left[\\dfrac{2x^3}{3}-\\dfrac{x^7}{14}\\right]_0^{\\sqrt2}=2\\left(\\dfrac{4\\sqrt2}{3}-\\dfrac{4\\sqrt2}{7}\\right)=2\\cdot4\\sqrt2\\left(\\dfrac13-\\dfrac17\\right)=8\\sqrt2\\cdot\\dfrac{4}{21}=\\dfrac{32\\sqrt2}{21}$",
        "结论：$\\displaystyle\\iint_D x^2y\\,dxdy=\\dfrac{32\\sqrt2}{21}$"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "求 $\\displaystyle\\iint_D x\\,dxdy$，其中 $D=\\{(x,y)\\mid 0\\le x\\le1, x\\le y\\le1\\}$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "二重积分基础",
        "累次积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "二重积分计算",
      "method": [
        "累次积分法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "写出内外层积分限",
        "先对 $y$ 积分再对 $x$ 积分"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "double_integral_basic",
        "template": "\\iint_{x\\le y\\le1,0\\le x\\le1} x\\,dxdy",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "内层：$\\int_x^1 x\\,dy=x(1-x)$",
            "外层：$\\int_0^1 x(1-x)dx=\\int_0^1(x-x^2)dx=1/2-1/3=1/6$",
            "结论：积分值为 $1/6$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2025-0964b49f99-q04-practice-01",
      "school": "京都大学",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "求 $\\displaystyle\\iint_D y\\,dxdy$，其中 $D=\\{(x,y)\\mid x^2\\le y\\le1\\}$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "二重积分",
        "对称区域"
      ],
      "question_type": "二重积分计算",
      "method": [
        "累次积分与对称性"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "确定 $x$ 范围",
        "内层对 $y$ 积分",
        "外层对 $x$ 积分并利用偶函数性质"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "double_integral_region",
        "template": "\\iint_{x^2\\le y\\le1} y\\,dxdy",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$x\\in[-1,1]$，内层：$\\int_{x^2}^1 y\\,dy=\\dfrac{1-x^4}{2}$",
            "外层：$\\int_{-1}^1\\dfrac{1-x^4}{2}dx=\\int_0^1(1-x^4)dx=1-1/5=4/5$",
            "结论：积分值为 $4/5$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2025-0964b49f99-q04-practice-02",
      "school": "京都大学",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "求 $\\displaystyle\\iint_D x^2\\,dxdy$，其中 $D=\\{(x,y)\\mid x^2\\le y\\le2\\}$（与原题同区域但不同被积函数）。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "二重积分",
        "累次积分",
        "偶函数对称性"
      ],
      "question_type": "二重积分计算",
      "method": [
        "累次积分法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "确定 $x$ 范围为 $[-\\sqrt2,\\sqrt2]$",
        "内层对 $y$ 积分（被积函数不含 $y$，直接乘以区间长度）",
        "外层对 $x$ 积分"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "double_integral_region",
        "template": "\\iint_{x^2\\le y\\le2} x^2\\,dxdy",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "内层：$\\int_{x^2}^2 x^2\\,dy = x^2(2-x^2)=2x^2-x^4$",
            "外层：$\\int_{-\\sqrt2}^{\\sqrt2}(2x^2-x^4)dx=2\\int_0^{\\sqrt2}(2x^2-x^4)dx=2\\left[\\dfrac{2x^3}{3}-\\dfrac{x^5}{5}\\right]_0^{\\sqrt2}$",
            "$=2\\left(\\dfrac{4\\sqrt2}{3}-\\dfrac{4\\sqrt2}{5}\\right)=2\\cdot4\\sqrt2\\left(\\dfrac13-\\dfrac15\\right)=8\\sqrt2\\cdot\\dfrac{2}{15}=\\dfrac{16\\sqrt2}{15}$",
            "结论：积分值为 $\\dfrac{16\\sqrt2}{15}$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2025-0964b49f99-q04-practice-03",
      "school": "京都大学",
      "year": "2025"
    }
